  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Production of shiitake mushrooms for the European market</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Three companies propose to set up shiitake production in Albania. The applicant H en S Trading B.V. was established three years ago and is a company specialised in trade of a wide variety of mushrooms &#x2013; through its daughter Exoten Champignons Trading Europe B.V..Local partner is AIBA Company Sh.A, a company for which the core business is egg production. Other activities AIBA Company Sh.A has engaged in are mixing and trade of animal feed and production of organic fertiliser.Third partner is a relatively new company from Kosovo, King Mushrooms Sh.P.K. King Mushrooms is specialised in trade of wild mushrooms.The three partners propose to set up a joint venture. The joint venture will have two main activities: it will produce shiitake and it will produce growing logs for other shiitake growers. The project will make use of the variety in climatic conditions in Albania. By growing shiitake both in the coastal region (around Durres) as well as in the mountainous region, shiitake can be produced year round under natural conditions. The growing locations of the joint venture will have a total capacity of 117 tons per year.In addition, 105 small farmers will be trained to be outgrowers with a total production capacity of 273 tons per year. The shiitake will be sold mainly at the Western European markets, thus replacing the import of Chinese shiitake.</narrative>
  </description>
